  "scaffoldSummary": "Pure, side-effect-free schema scaffold for the requirements_request_letter workflow mode designed in Phase 9A and registered in Phase 9B, closing the dedicated-schema gap acknowledged as registry-only/pending in Phase 9G and Phase 9H. No imports from runtime pipeline/server/routes; no network, Supabase, OpenAI, Google Drive, n8n, Firecrawl, or Crawlee dependency; no filesystem access; no process.env dependency; no Date.now/randomness; no side effects. Generates no live requirements request letters; not wired into ask-handler.js, pipeline.js, server.js, routes, or the frontend. Does not modify the Phase 9G governance gate or the Phase 9H runtime-wiring policy.",
